WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.709
Good morning, Hank. It's Sunday. Bonus video!

00:00:01.709 --> 00:00:03.120
So an opinion poll last week found that

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.480
more than 20% of Americans believe that the President of the United States,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.440
Barack Obama,

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.240
is a Muslim.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.229
Now Obama has repeatedly said that he is a Christian,

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.270
but he also repeatedly said he'd allow us to import prescription drugs from Canada

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.160
and that hasn't happened.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.319
So instead of taking Obama's word that he is not a Muslim,

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.740
I thought today we could do an analysis

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.040
of what we know about Barack Obama

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.160
and what we know about Islam

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.520
and come to our own conclusions.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.800
So the five most central facets of Islamic belief and practice are known as the "Five Pillars of Islam."

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.380
The first is the "Shahada",

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.660
the recitation and belief in the statement that

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.780
"There is no deity other than God and that Muhammad is God's prophet."

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.480
You're not a Muslim until you say and believe the shahada.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.620
We can't prove the president Obama has ever said the shahada,

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.590
but we also can't prove that he hasn't said it.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.680
So let's move on.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.720
The second pillar is prayer.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.780
Now as many of us know, observant Muslims pray at least five times a day:

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:48.640
dawn, noon, mid-afternoon, sunset and night time.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.525
And it just so happens that we know a lot about Barack Obama's daily schedule

00:00:51.525 --> 00:00:52.740
because he's the President.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.280
So, for instance, we know that on April  8th 2010,

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.340
during evening prayers,

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.580
Obama was having dinner with Dmitry Medvedev,

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:01.590
who you will be surprised to learn did not emerge from that dinner saying,

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.940
"Oh my God,

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:06.600
Barack Obama pulled out a prayer rug,

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.080
turned it in the direction of the Kaaba and proceeded to pray."

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.120
We also know that on April 5th 2010,

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.280
during noon prayers,

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.000
Barack Obama was hosting the White House Easter Egg Hunt.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.060
Nobody at that event noted Barack Obama

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.040
prostrate on the ground praying in Arabic.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.100
The third pillar of Islam is "Zakāt".

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:27.040
Zakāt is almsgiving;  Muslims are required to give 2.5% of their wealth every year to the poor.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.300
The public has access to a lot of Obama's tax returns

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.100
and between 2000 and 2005,

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.020
he and Michelle gave an average of less than

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:35.140
1% of their income to charity.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.560
Meaning that, in addition to being a bit of a tightwad,

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.240
Barack Obama was not performing zakāt.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.440
The fourth pillar is "Sawm" or fasting.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.620
During the holy month of Ramadan, Muslims do not eat or drink

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.320
between dawn and dusk.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.440
Ramadan began this year on August 11th.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:52.407
On August 17th, a photographer snapped this picture

00:01:52.407 --> 00:01:54.300
of Barack Obama ordering lunch,

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.720
which he proceeded to eat in front of hundreds of people.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.460
In fact,

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:01.000
the president has been seen eating and drinking during the day,

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.360
pretty much every single day of Ramadan.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.180
The fifth pillar is "Hajj" or pilgrimage.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:10.440
Muslims who can afford to do so and are able-bodied are obligated to make the pilgrimage to Mecca,

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.020
at least once in their lives.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:13.700
Obama has not yet made this trip.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.440
Although here's still time.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.660
But it's unlikely he ever will for this reason:

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.180
the Saudi government will not let you into Mecca

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.080
if you are not a Muslim

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.020
and Barack Obama is not a Muslim.

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.720
So while it's possible that Barack Obama has said Shahada

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.040
at some private moment that we don't know about,

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:30.060
he completely and spectacularly fails to follow any of the other four pillars of Islam.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.290
So we don't even have to get into the fact that he drinks beer

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.920
and eats pork hotdogs,

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:34.760
humorously.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.120
This means one of two possibilities:

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.240
Hank, either President Obama is not a Muslim,

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.700
or he is a really bad Muslim.

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.320
Of course, there's nothing wrong with being a Muslim;

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.950
President Obama just isn't one.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.740
He's also not Jewish,

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:45.880
not a baby

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.600
and not the starting left fielder for the New York Yankees.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.220
So Drudge Report, Huffington Post, CNN, Fox News,

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.600
maybe we can find something else to talk about.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.620
Hank, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.640
Oh and PS.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:56.570
this suit-

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.510
it isn't all business.

